{
    "title": "Shutterfly: Prints Cards Gifts",
    "description": "Welcome to your one-stop shop for creating meaningful, personalized photo gifts, holiday cards, home decor, photo books, prints, calendars, and more. With Shutterfly, you can make something that means something\u2014each personalized item carries a powerful emotional connection, from heartfelt wedding invitations, birthday cards, and graduation announcements to unique photo gifts like jigsaw puzzles and cozy throw blankets. Create and share moments that matter.\r\n\r\nOur app features include:\r\n\u2022 Return & recipient address printing for all your envelopes so you can save a ton of time.\r\n\u2022 Our 24-Hour Photo Book Designer Service \u2014 now you can finish your book on the app with any edits you may have! Get started by simply uploading all your photos and let a Shutterfly designer place the best ones in your book for you.\r\n\u2022 Improved navigation tools to make finding your new favorite products even easier.\r\n\u2022 Artistic filters to turn your special memories into beautiful sketches that can be used on gifts for your whole list.\r\n\u2022 Easily access your photos stored with Shutterfly, Amazon Photos, Google Photos, Facebook, Instagram, or on your own device when creating a photo personalized item.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to your one-stop shop for creating meaningful, personalized photo gifts, holiday cards, home decor, photo books, prints, calendars, and more. With Shutterfly, you can make something that means something\u2014each personalized item carries a powerful emotional connection, from heartfelt wedding invitations, birthday cards, and graduation announcements to unique photo gifts like jigsaw puzzles and cozy throw blankets. Create and share moments that matter.<br><br>Our app features include:<br>\u2022 Return &amp; recipient address printing for all your envelopes so you can save a ton of time.<br>\u2022 Our 24-Hour Photo Book Designer Service \u2014 now you can finish your book on the app with any edits you may have! Get started by simply uploading all your photos and let a Shutterfly designer place the best ones in your book for you.<br>\u2022 Improved navigation tools to make finding your new favorite products even easier.<br>\u2022 Artistic filters to turn your special memories into beautiful sketches that can be used on gifts for your whole list.<br>\u2022 Easily access your photos stored with Shutterfly, Amazon Photos, Google Photos, Facebook, Instagram, or on your own device when creating a photo personalized item.",
